# Licensing status

The final copyright-holder list and publication license for the original project
code have not been supplied or approved by all contributors. This package does
not invent a grant by unidentified authors. Before public distribution, the
actual rights holders must select and approve the code and data licenses.

The exact SQLite input files retain their upstream public-domain notices.
The optional Z3 library is not redistributed; its upstream MIT/Expat notice is
retained under licenses/. Publisher template assets, in the separate paper
directory of the full project, retain their own upstream notices.
